          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পায়চারি করা (pāychāri kôrā) joins পায়চারি, \"walking to and fro\", to করা, to do; the origin of পায়চারি is not settled."
